    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24361" root="صعل" body-key="S">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعِلَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعَلَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعَلٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He,</i>
or <i>it, was,</i> or <i>became, such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَعْلٌ</span> <i>and</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْعَلُ</span> meaning as expl. below; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصعالّ</span></b> .
(K, TA.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">النَّخْلَةُ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصعالّت</span></b>  meaning
<i>The palm-tree was,</i> or <i>became, slender in the head.</i>
(IDrd, O, TA.)

